        -: 1593:// Method #0 for choosing a partition:
        -: 1594:// As the seeds for the two groups, pick the two rects that would waste the
        -: 1595:// most area if covered by a single rectangle, i.e. evidently the worst pair
        -: 1596:// to have in the same group.
