        -: 1599:// depending on which group - the rect most strongly attracted to one group
        -: 1600:// and repelled from the other.
        -: 1601:// If one group gets too full (more would force other group to violate min
        -: 1602:// fill requirement) then other group gets the rest.
        -: 1603:// These last are the ones that can go in either group most easily.
